---
import CallToAction from "@/components/common/CallToAction.astro";
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <article
    class="container prose-lg mx-auto my-20 w-screen prose-headings:font-medium"
  >
    <h1>Terms of Use for FlowArc Studio Website</h1>

    <section>
      <h2>1. General Provisions</h2>
      <p>
        1.1. This document (hereinafter referred to as the "Terms") defines the
        conditions for using the FlowArc Studio website (hereinafter referred to
        as the "Website") and the services of FlowArc Studio (hereinafter
        referred to as the "Company").
      </p>
      <p>
        1.2. By using the Website, you confirm that you have read and agree to
        these Terms.
      </p>
      <p>
        1.3. The Company reserves the right to make changes to these Terms. The
        current version is always available on the Website.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>2. Services</h2>
      <p>2.1. The Company provides the following services:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Website development</li>
        <li>Business process automation</li>
        <li>Project management</li>
        <li>UI/UX design</li>
        <li>Technical support</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        2.2. Specific service conditions, timelines, and costs are agreed upon
        separately and documented in a contract.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>3. User Rights and Obligations</h2>
      <p>3.1. Users have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Receive information about the Company's services</li>
        <li>Request consultations through contact forms</li>
        <li>Order services as per published offers</li>
      </ul>
      <p>3.2. Users are obligated to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Provide accurate information when interacting with the Company</li>
        <li>Not use the Website for illegal activities</li>
        <li>Not violate the Company's intellectual property rights</li>
        <li>Not attempt unauthorized access to the Website</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>4. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>
        4.1. All materials on the Website (including texts, images, logos, and
        designs) are the intellectual property of the Company or are used under
        license.
      </p>
      <p>
        4.2. Using Website materials without the Company's written consent is
        prohibited.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        5.1. The Company makes every effort to ensure the relevance and accuracy
        of the information on the Website but does not guarantee absolute
        accuracy.
      </p>
      <p>5.2. The Company is not responsible for:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Technical failures of the Website</li>
        <li>Actions of third parties</li>
        <li>Indirect losses related to Website use</li>
        <li>Decisions made based on information from the Website</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>6. Confidentiality</h2>
      <p>
        6.1. The processing of personal data is carried out in accordance with
        the Company's Privacy Policy.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>7. Dispute Resolution</h2>
      <p>
        7.1. All disputes arising from the use of the Website shall be resolved
        through negotiations.
      </p>
      <p>
        7.2. If an agreement cannot be reached, disputes will be resolved in
        accordance with Ukrainian legislation.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>8. Contact Information</h2>
      <p>
        8.1. For questions regarding the Website or Company services, contact:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Email: [Insert email]</li>
        <li>Phone: [Insert phone]</li>
        <li>Address: [Insert address]</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>9. Final Provisions</h2>
      <p>
        9.1. These Terms are drafted in accordance with Ukrainian legislation.
      </p>
      <p>
        9.2. If any provision of these Terms is deemed invalid, it does not
        affect the validity of the remaining provisions.
      </p>
      <p>
        9.3. These Terms take effect from the moment of their publication on the
        Website.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-10 font-bold">Last updated: 08.01.2025</p>
    </section>
  </article>
  <CallToAction title="Need Automation Support?" buttonLabel="Request Support">
    <p slot="description" class="max-w-lg text-lg">
      Let’s discuss how we can help keep your systems running at peak
      performance with expert maintenance, continuous monitoring, and
      performance updates.
    </p>
  </CallToAction>
</Layout>
